# Cloud study FRESH-2 #30, tuned 5x. Exam on 128 fresh worlds: 29.8 meals, 125/128 immortal
# (confine 23.5). Its author's hypothesis:
# A new axis — connectivity. A second, walk-only wave (`hope`) spreads the same sources
# but stops dead at every solid cell, so it measures what is reachable on foot without
# pressing; a wall face's probe is silenced wherever the free ground beside it still has
# hope, and runs at full strength only where nothing is reachable. The agent then stops
# wasting presses on the inner walls of an escapable enclosure (the 40 idle presses on
# world 116), and in a truly sealed pocket the faces are the only thing in the field, so
# the grain-ranked winner face gets all the effort.

# Hope: a walk-only wave (no leak through solid). A wall face pulls only where hope is
# low, i.e. where nothing worth having is reachable on foot -- press only when walled in.
channel source
channel solid
channel free
channel thing
channel here
channel bad
channel leak
channel value
channel trail
channel confinement
channel injection
channel hope
channel nbmax
channel aim
channel work
channel thin
channel grain
channel face
channel crest
channel probe
rule seed:
  when grain <= 0
  set grain = uniform(0.001, 1)
rule walk:
  when 1
  set trail = max(here, 0.91 * max8(here), 0.997 * trail)
rule calc_conf:
  when 1
  set confinement = sum8(solid)
rule calc_thin:
  when 1
  set thin = max(shift(free, 1, 0) * (1 - shift(solid, -1, 0)), shift(free, -1, 0) * (1 - shift(solid, 1, 0)), shift(free, 0, 1) * (1 - shift(solid, 0, -1)), shift(free, 0, -1) * (1 - shift(solid, 0, 1)))
rule calc_face:
  when 1
  set face = solid * thin * leak * (1 - bad) * (0.4 + 0.6 * grain)
rule calc_crest:
  when 1
  set crest = max(face, 0.93 * max8(crest))
rule inject:
  when 1
  set injection = max(thing, source * (0.74 - 0.82 * trail)) * (0.83 - bad) / (1 + 0.83 * confinement)
# Hope: what is reachable WITHOUT pressing; solid stops it completely, poison too.
rule calc_hope:
  when 1
  set hope = max(injection, 0.94 * max4(hope), 0.916214 * max8(hope)) * (1 - solid) * (1 - 0.9 * bad)
rule calc_nbmax:
  when 1
  set nbmax = max8(value)
rule calc_aim:
  when 1
  set aim = max8(here) * (1 - here) * where(value >= max8(here * nbmax) - 0.000001, 1, 0) * where(max8(here * nbmax) > 0, 1, 0)
rule effort:
  when 1
  set work = min(1, 0.68 * work + 0.03 * aim * solid)
# Probes as before, but silenced where the free ground beside the face still has hope.
rule calc_probe:
  when 1
  set probe = where(face > 0, 1, 0) * (face * (0.06 * clamp(1 - 1.4 * trail, 0, 0.56) + 0.3 * work) + 0.05 * where(face >= crest - 0.000001, 1, 0)) * clamp(1 - 6 * max8(hope), 0, 1)
rule wave:
  when 1
  set value = max(injection, probe, 0.94 * max4(value), 0.8161 * max8(value)) * (1 - solid * (1.3 - leak)) * (1 - 0.9 * bad)
